# Everything under this directory is a mount point for HPC scratch, so its contents are host
# state rather than source. The python-lamindb container binds hub-storage/hpc_scratch at
# /scratch, so on any host that is not the HPC make schema-apply registers the declared root
# storage.hpc_root, a /scratch/... path, into the working tree and leaves a .lamindb directory
# there. This keeps that out of the index.
*
!.gitignore
